  {id:"sunat", t:["Amalan sunat","Sunnah acts"], k:"S",
    i:[["Mandi sunat ihram, masuk Makkah, wukuf dan melontar","Bathing for ihram, entering Makkah, Arafah and stoning"],["Memakai wangian pada badan sebelum ihram","Perfume on the body before ihram"],["Solat sunat ihram dua rakaat","Two rakaat before ihram"],["Memperbanyak talbiah","Saying the talbiyah often"],["Tawaf qudum (bagi ifrad dan qiran)","The arrival tawaf (ifrad and qiran)"],["Idhtiba' dan ramal (lelaki)","Idtiba' and raml (men)"],["Mengucup atau isyarat ke Hajar Aswad dan menyentuh Rukun Yamani","Kissing or pointing to the Black Stone and touching the Yamani corner"],["Solat sunat tawaf di belakang Maqam Ibrahim","The tawaf prayer behind Maqam Ibrahim"],["Minum air Zamzam","Drinking Zamzam"],["Berdoa di Multazam","Doa at al-Multazam"],["Naik ke Safa dan Marwah dan berlari-lari anak di antara lampu hijau (lelaki)","Climbing Safa and Marwah and jogging between the green lights (men)"],["Bermalam di Mina pada malam 9 Zulhijjah","The night of 9 Dhul Hijjah in Mina"],["Berada di Arafah sehingga matahari terbenam","Staying at Arafah until sunset"],["Berhenti di Masy'aril Haram","Stopping at al-Mash'ar al-Haram"],["Mengutip batu di Muzdalifah","Picking pebbles at Muzdalifah"],["Berdoa selepas Jamrah Ula dan Wusta","Doa after al-Ula and al-Wusta"],["Lelaki bercukur seluruh kepala","Men shaving the whole head"],["Nafar thani","Staying on to the 13th"],["Ziarah Madinah","Visiting Madinah"]]},
  {id:"larangan", t:["Larangan ihram","Ihram prohibitions"], k:"W",
    i:[["Lelaki: memakai pakaian berjahit yang melingkungi badan, dan menutup kepala","Men: stitched clothing that wraps the body, and covering the head"],["Wanita: menutup muka dan memakai sarung tangan","Women: covering the face and wearing gloves"],["Memakai wangian pada badan atau pakaian","Perfume on the body or clothes"],["Meminyakkan rambut kepala atau janggut","Oiling the hair or beard"],["Memotong atau mencabut rambut dan bulu","Cutting or pulling out hair"],["Memotong kuku","Cutting nails"],["Memburu atau membunuh binatang darat yang liar","Hunting or killing wild land animals"],["Memotong atau mencabut pokok di Tanah Haram","Cutting or uprooting plants in the Haram"],["Berkahwin, mengahwinkan atau meminang","Marrying, conducting a marriage or proposing"],["Bersentuhan dengan syahwat dan bersetubuh","Intimate touching and intercourse"]]},
  {id:"tahallul", t:["Tahallul","Leaving ihram"], k:"A",
    i:[["Tahallul awal: selepas dua daripada tiga (lontar Aqabah, bercukur, tawaf ifadah dengan sa'ie). Semua larangan terangkat kecuali nikah dan hubungan suami isteri.","First release: after two of the three (stoning Aqabah, haircut, tawaf al-ifadah with sa'i). Everything is allowed again except marriage and intimacy."],["Tahallul thani: selepas ketiga-tiganya. Semua larangan ihram terangkat.","Second release: after all three. Every ihram rule is lifted."],["Umrah: tahallul selepas bercukur atau bergunting.","Umrah: you leave ihram after the haircut."]]},
  {id:"jenis", t:["Tiga cara menunaikan haji","Three ways to perform hajj"], k:"A",
    i:[["Ifrad: haji dahulu, kemudian umrah selepas haji. Tiada dam. Afdal dalam mazhab Syafi'i jika umrah dibuat pada tahun yang sama.","Ifrad: hajj first, then umrah afterwards. No dam. Preferred in the Shafi'i school if the umrah is done the same year."],["Tamattu': umrah dalam bulan haji, tahallul, kemudian berihram haji dari Makkah pada tahun yang sama. Wajib dam.","Tamattu': umrah in the hajj months, leave ihram, then enter hajj ihram from Makkah the same year. Dam is due."],["Qiran: berniat haji dan umrah serentak. Wajib dam.","Qiran: niat for hajj and umrah together. Dam is due."]]},
  {id:"dam", t:["Jenis-jenis dam","Types of dam"], k:"D", note:["Dam disembelih di Tanah Haram dan dagingnya untuk fakir miskin di sana. 1 cupak (mud) kira-kira 600 g makanan asasi. Rujuk pegawai Tabung Haji atau mutawwif.","Dam is slaughtered in the Haram and the meat goes to the poor there. 1 mud is about 600 g of staple food. Ask Tabung Haji officers or your guide."],
    i:[["Dam tertib dan taqdir: haji tamattu', qiran, dan meninggalkan wajib (miqat, Muzdalifah, Mina, melontar, tawaf wada'). Sembelih seekor kambing; jika tidak mampu, puasa 10 hari (3 semasa haji, 7 di tanah air).","Fixed-order dam: tamattu', qiran, and missing an obligation (miqat, Muzdalifah, Mina, stoning, farewell tawaf). Slaughter a sheep or goat; if you cannot, fast 10 days (3 during hajj, 7 at home)."],["Kurang daripada tiga: tertinggal satu malam di Mina atau satu biji batu = 1 cupak makanan; dua = 2 cupak; tiga atau lebih = seekor kambing.","Less than three: missing one Mina night or one pebble = 1 mud of food; two = 2 mud; three or more = a sheep."],["Dam takhyir dan taqdir: bercukur atau memotong 3 helai rambut atau 3 kuku, memakai wangian, pakaian berjahit, menutup kepala (lelaki) atau muka (wanita), minyak rambut, bersentuhan dengan syahwat. Pilih: sembelih seekor kambing, atau puasa 3 hari, atau sedekah 6 cupak (3 gantang) kepada 6 orang miskin.","Choice dam: shaving or cutting 3 hairs or 3 nails, perfume, stitched clothes, covering the head (men) or face (women), oiling the hair, intimate touching. Choose one: slaughter a sheep, or fast 3 days, or give 3 sa' of food to 6 poor people."],["Satu helai rambut atau satu kuku = 1 cupak; dua = 2 cupak.","One hair or one nail = 1 mud; two = 2 mud."],["Dam takhyir dan ta'dil: membunuh binatang buruan atau memotong pokok di Tanah Haram. Pilih: sembelih binatang yang setara, atau sedekah makanan senilainya, atau puasa sehari bagi setiap cupak.","Choice-by-value dam: killing game or cutting trees in the Haram. Choose: slaughter an equal animal, or give food of its value, or fast one day per mud."],["Dam tertib dan ta'dil: bersetubuh sebelum tahallul awal (haji batal, wajib diteruskan dan diqada) atau terhalang (ihsar). Seekor unta; jika tidak mampu, lembu, kemudian 7 ekor kambing, kemudian makanan senilai unta, kemudian puasa.","Fixed-order-by-value dam: intercourse before the first release (the hajj is spoiled but must be completed and repeated) or being blocked (ihsar). A camel; if not, a cow, then 7 sheep, then food worth a camel, then fasting."]]},
  {id:"wanita", t:["Wanita yang haid atau nifas","Women in menses or post-natal bleeding"], k:"A",
    i:[["Boleh berihram, wukuf, bermalam di Muzdalifah dan Mina, melontar dan sa'ie (jika tawaf sudah dibuat).","May enter ihram, stand at Arafah, stay at Muzdalifah and Mina, stone the jamarat, and do sa'i (if the tawaf is done)."],["Tidak boleh tawaf sehingga suci. Tawaf ifadah ditangguhkan; tawaf wada' gugur.","No tawaf until clean. Tawaf al-ifadah is delayed; the farewell tawaf is dropped."],["Berbincang dengan pegawai Tabung Haji tentang pil penangguhan haid sebelum berangkat.","Talk to Tabung Haji staff about period-delaying pills before you travel."]]}
